<div class="flex_cell av-f5siuf-d9cbdfe352ffe7d927d5cb663d7cc74e av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-51 el_before_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-first content-align-top"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
<div class="flex_column av-dfs0h3-d26c714074ad1024f3735ef08808298f av_one_full avia-builder-el-52 avia-builder-el-no-sibling mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8osf5kx-d8404be9d37adab6f0e5d044c3a4df34 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-53 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Macro and Micronutrient Survey</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osfdq8-93ff699a3dbec4567278fd9bfd8761a5" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Macro and micronutrients are essential for maintaining health and well-being. Vitamins play critical roles in various bodily functions, from immune support to energy production, while minerals are vital for bone health, muscle function, and hydration balance.</p>
<p>Amino acids, the building blocks of proteins, are crucial for tissue repair and hormone production. Body fat evaluation assesses your risk for heart disease and diabetes. Analyzing carbohydrate intake helps determine energy levels and can guide dietary choices for weight management.</p>
<p>Stool culture and examination detect gastrointestinal issues, such as infections or imbalances in gut flora. Lastly, an allergen profile and food intolerance testing identify foods that may trigger adverse reactions, enabling you to make informed dietary decisions and improve your quality of life.</p>
</div></section></div></div></div><div class="flex_cell av-cwcupz-06ec24411add83771e56e27fcd0adf14 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-55 el_after_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-last content-align-top avia-full-stretch"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
