<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8or19hq-2f333321140720ef35acc321a3bbf25b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Genetic testing analyzes DNA sequences and offers insights into your true biological age, which may differ from your chronological age. This understanding can help tailor personalized health strategies and lifestyle changes to promote longevity and well-being.</p>
<p><strong>Genetic testing empowers you with knowledge, enabling you to make informed decisions about screenings and preventive measures.</strong></p>
<p>Cancer risk analysis is particularly significant, as it identifies genetic predispositions to various types of cancer. Early detection and intervention can substantially improve outcomes, making it vital for individuals with a family history of cancer.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column av-9d5lbr-7057e9b64cfa2ff30f23e135164373bf av_one_full avia-builder-el-79 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="hr av-m8osig1z-6fd6c8fcb5ab6d97695b6d1a143fc6cd hr-custom avia-builder-el-80 el_before_av_heading avia-builder-el-first hr-center hr-icon-no"><span class="hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<div class="av-special-heading av-m8osgfh3-37bcdc3918168451bf55bb87c947483b av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-81 el_after_av_hr el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Brain/Blood Transmitter Analysis</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8osgm09-f11aaad15862e7350274edbfc738352b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Brain and blood transmitter analysis focuses on dopamine and serotonin, which regulate mood, behavior, and cognitive functions. These neurotransmitters are often associated with mental health conditions, where imbalances can lead to disorders like <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">depression and anxiety</a>.</p>
<p>Analyzing specific markers in the brain and bloodstream leads to more effective treatments and help if you are experiencing related mental health issues.</p>
</div></section></div>
