<p>By evaluating factors like immune response, hormonal levels, and genetic markers, you can better understand your health status and potential risks. Advanced testing, including nutrient surveys and blood transmitter analyses, helps identify deficiencies or imbalances that can impact both physical and mental well-being.</p>
<p>At Casa Privée, we develop personalized health strategies, enabling proactive measures to prevent diseases like cancer or cardiovascular issues. Medical imaging further enhances this proactive approach by identifying early structural abnormalities or metabolic changes.</p>
